Created Apr 21, 2022, 10:53PM::md .update
Summary::md .summary
  There is a fake in game clipboard so the system one is unaffected. I should
  add the ability to copy-paste to the system clipboard as well. It would be
  fairly easy and just serialize to json. The difficulty is that a javascript
  validator needs to be written, which is annoying. It should be generated from
  types.shared.

Updated May 13, 2022, 04:50PM::md .update
  What is the use case for this? Why did I file this bug?

WontFix Jun 16, 2022, 02:26AM::md .update
  I can’t figure out why you would want this, so wontfix

Reopened Jul 04, 2022, 09:09PM::md .update
  Oh! This is so you can copy paste between campaigns so you can predraw
  treasure maps, etc. as the Dm.

Updated Jul 05, 2022, 09:45AM::md .update
  Clipboard api doesn’t seem to be supported on firefox

Updated Jul 06, 2022, 10:50AM::md .update
  Writing to clipboard is supported, but reading isn’t. I added a work-around
  dialogue.

Resolved Jul 06, 2022, 10:50AM::md .update
  Wrote a validator and implemented pasting objects from clipboard.
